<title>USA: Hain Food stake raised by Soros group.</title>
<headline>Hain Food stake raised by Soros group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by international financier George Soros said Friday it has nearly doubled its stake to the equivalent of 15.71 percent or 1.3 million shares, which includes options.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently acquired a net 543,000 shares between June 19 and July 8 at $5.13 to $6.05 a share.</p>
<p>The group sold 15,000 shares between May 16 and June 17 at $4.16 to $4.67 each, according to the filing.</p>
</text>
